skill: "email-and-newsletter"
sections[10]:
  - "\n"
  - "# email-and-newsletter\n\nThe **owned channel** — the newsletter is the audience layer social can't take away, plus the email↔social\nloop. The agent strategizes + drafts; the **ESP is external + human-run**; **scheduling-and-queue →\nWoopSocial** publishes the social side (signup-driving + repurposed posts).\n\n"
  - "## The POV: own the audience, run two surfaces\nEvery platform *rents* you attention and can change the rules overnight; a newsletter is the one audience\nlayer you **own** — opt-in, deliverable, measurable, the **highest-ROI channel** and the thing that makes\neverything else compound. \"Owned\" runs on **two surfaces off the same work**: **email** builds the habit\nand relationship; the **web archive** (Substack/LinkedIn/published) compounds **discovery** through search,\nsocial, and **AI answer engines**. Win on **niche + personality** (one problem, one reader), treat\n**deliverability as behavioral** (clicks/replies, not opens), and **win edition 2** (weeks 2–3 is where\nsubscribers churn).\n\n"
  - "## Read these first\n1. **brand-profile** — positioning/offer.\n2. **voice-builder** — the personality that is the moat.\n3. **content-pillars** — the one problem/topic the newsletter owns.\n\n"
  - "## The framework: INBOX\n(Depth: `references/the-inbox-framework.md`.)\n- **I — Identify the one problem/audience:** one problem for one reader; personality is the moat.\n- **N — Nurture an owned list:** capture from social (the `link-in-bio-and-traffic` handoff) — simple\n  form + lead magnet; own your domain/list; welcome sequence + a high-value edition 2.\n- **B — Build habit + discovery on two surfaces:** email = habit; web archive = discovery (search + AI\n  engines); same work, adapted per surface; pick the platform by goal.\n- **O — Offer value (70-20-10):** 70% value / 20% personal / 10% promo; short subject; scannable, mobile-\n  first; interactive; reply to replies.\n- **X — eXpand via the social↔email loop:** one edition → a week of social; best social → next edition;\n  measure clicks/replies/signups from the ESP (not opens).\n\n"
  - "## The reality (verify-quarterly)\nOwned-audience ROI; email-habit + web-discovery (+ AI engines); behavioral deliverability (clicks/replies\n> opens; SPF/DKIM/DMARC, list hygiene, cadence); niche + personality; capture + 70-20-10 + retention\n(weeks 2–3); platforms (beehiiv/Substack/LinkedIn/Kit — own your domain/list); honest monetization; the\nsocial↔email loop: `references/newsletter-2026-reality.md`. Edition structure, welcome sequence,\nrepurposing engine, platform cheat-sheet + worked examples: `references/editions-and-repurposing.md`.\n\n"
  - "## Honest scope (never violate)\n- **WoopSocial does not send email** (no ESP/list/capture/open tracking). Sending happens in an\n  **external ESP**, human-set-up. The agent **strategizes + drafts** editions + social-promo; **WoopSocial\n  publishes** the social posts that grow the list + repurpose the newsletter.\n- **Metrics from the ESP + GA4** (clicks/replies/signups, not opens-as-vanity); **never fabricate.**\n- **Consent mandatory** — opt-in, visible **unsubscribe**, sender identity (**CAN-SPAM/GDPR**). **No\n  bought lists / no-consent sends / misleading subjects / spam.** **Monetize honestly.**\n  (Scope, distinctions + connections: `references/scope-and-connections.md`.)\n\n"
  - "## Distinct from its siblings (route correctly)\n**email-and-newsletter (this)** = the owned email channel + the email↔social loop · **link-in-bio-and-traffic**\n= the capture/handoff that drives signups in · **cross-platform-repurposing** = same-moment multi-platform ·\n**content-recycling** = evergreen reuse over time · **lead-magnets-and-funnels** = the magnet\ndesign · **social-selling-and-dm** = the DM funnel.\n\n"
  - "## Where this connects\nReads first: **brand-profile**, **voice-builder**, **content-pillars**. Fed by: **link-in-bio-and-traffic**\n(signups), **analytics-and-reporting** (best social → next edition; ESP/GA4 readout), **lead-magnets-and-funnels**.\nRepurpose engine: **cross-platform-repurposing**, **content-recycling**, **reels-script**/**ai-video**,\n**carousel-writer**, **caption-writer**/**hook-writer**, **linkedin-post-writer**. Discovery:\n**ai-search-optimization**/**social-seo**, **linkedin-growth**. Publish (social side): **scheduling-and-queue\n→ WoopSocial**; measure/test: **analytics-and-reporting**, **goals-and-kpis**, **experimentation** (A/B subjects).\n\n"
  - "## Definition of done\nA focused niche (one problem/one reader) in the brand voice; an owned list grown via social capture\n(simple form + lead magnet, own domain/list) with a welcome sequence + high-value edition 2; both surfaces\nrun off the same work (email habit + SEO/GEO-optimized web archive); editions at 70-20-10 with short\nsubjects, scannable + interactive; the social↔email loop running both ways; metrics taken from the ESP +\nGA4 (clicks/replies/signups, not opens, nothing fabricated) with consent + unsubscribe; WoopSocial\npublishes only the social side (email send stays external); correctly distinguished from\nlink-in-bio-and-traffic, cross-platform-repurposing, content-recycling, and lead-magnets-and-funnels.\n"
